  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel treats wind path as a named cultivation path with mortal Gu Masters, Immortal bodies, killer moves, and clan true inheritances, not as a generic word for air. Xiong Feng, wearing a bamboo hat and squinting habitually, is named a wind path rank three initial stage Gu Master among the three Xiong brothers who each cultivate a different path.",
      "chapters": [
        329
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_xiong_feng",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among Shang clan city’s battle-stage Gu Masters, Xiong Feng is named a wind path rank three initial stage Gu Master, one of three Xiong brothers whose paths are earth, fire, and wind.",
      "chapters": [
        329
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shang_clan_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Gu Masters become immortals, the Gu worm used to form the immortal aperture classifies them into paths such as wind path Gu Immortals. A wind path immortal body holds the dao marks and comprehension of wind, so wind path Gu worms work with greater effect. One mysterious Gu Immortal uses the wind path killer move Tornado Dragon Whip, a wind whip hundreds of meters long that kills flying cranes, and is identified as a wind path Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        703
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-body-and-killer-move",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "move_tornado_dragon_whip"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu clan cultivates many paths but is most proficient in wind path, and Wu Zhan Ping names that proficiency as why the clan stands at the top of Southern Border’s Gu Immortal world. Wu clan has the strongest wind path true inheritance, and first supreme elder Wu Yong cultivates wind path and uses that strongest wind path true inheritance, though competition among wind path cultivators is steep.",
      "chapters": [
        2096
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
